      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5adfa711a8ca626f7bf243ae|full_name}: Cameras were made friends-only for multiple reasons. Performance was a major one.\n\nWe may potentially re-visit this issue in the future, but for now, cameras will likely remain disabled unless you're friends with the user in question. Although it isn't entirely intuitive and isn't documented well (or at all), the performance cost of even a single camera on someone else's avatar is massive.\n\nView-switching exploits were in fact only marginally related to cameras on avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
